@startuml
title ЛР16. Послідовність локальної перевірки та CI

actor Developer
participant GitHub
participant "GitHub Actions" as CI
participant JDK
participant "clang++" as Clang
participant Maven
participant Tests
participant JavaNormalizer
participant "Native library\nlibnativenormalizer.so" as NativeLib

Developer -> GitHub : push / pull request
GitHub -> CI : trigger workflow

CI -> JDK : setup Java 21
CI -> JDK : javac -h native-headers
CI -> Clang : build native library
Clang --> CI : libnativenormalizer.so

CI -> Maven : mvn compile
CI -> Maven : mvn test

Maven -> Tests : run unit tests
Tests -> JavaNormalizer : normalize(values)
Tests -> NativeLib : call JNI normalize(values)

JavaNormalizer --> Tests : java result
NativeLib --> Tests : native result

Tests -> Tests : compare Java and native results
Tests --> Maven : passed
Maven --> CI : success
CI --> GitHub : workflow passed

@enduml